<Text>&lt;P align=center&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;U&gt;&lt;FONT size=5&gt;M9703 FPGA Design Kit Tutorial Example&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/U&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &apos;Calibri&apos;,&apos;sans-serif&apos;; LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA&quot;&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &apos;Calibri&apos;,&apos;sans-serif&apos;; LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA&quot;&gt;This is&amp;nbsp;a simple FIR filter example to go through the whole M9703 FPGA design flow. You can find the&amp;nbsp;detailed description in Document:&amp;nbsp;&#x201C;Home &amp;gt;&amp;nbsp;Tutorials &amp;gt; Hardware Design &amp;gt; M9703 FPGA Design&#x201D;.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;</Text>
